 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS: 晩春〜初夏に半分まで刈り込める（夏前の刈り込み）。MBG・種は「条件が合えばこぼれ種ではびこりうる」と条件つきで、mixing も「強い」なので E にしなかった。機械の A から変更",
  "management_type_quote": "can be cut back by up to half in late spring or early summer",
  "management_type_by_matching": "A 放任型",
  "heat_west_only": "強",
  "muggy_west_only": "強",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[日照] 今のマスターの日照（日向〜半日陰）で西日耐性を決め直した（文献の日照 半日陰 なら ×）\n[MBG/種] Tolerant of a wide range of growing conditions and soil types, including dry shade, occasional drought, moist, poorly draining clay soils, sandy soils, heat and humidity.\n[NC State/種] Grassland sedge tolerates full sun to partial or full shade and a wide range of soil conditions, from dry to boggy, as well as heat and humidity.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: West-facing or South-facing or North-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] Given the right conditions, it will self-seed and naturalize in the landscape.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] MBG は 3 相当",
  "mixing_evidence": "[MBG・種] Can self-seed aggressively under the right conditions.",
